                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The gaps are small. But they apply to hundreds of thousands of patients, in the same direction, month after month. The dashboard identifies who is affected. It does not yet explain why. Whether referral practice, specialty mix, cancellation rates, or something else entirely. This requires further investigation.",
